      "projections": [
        {
          "state": "PASS_CONTIGUOUS_RAW_SPAN",
          "span": {
            "sourceId": "S1",
            "sourceSha256": "efbfdd21fa21c7e482bbe73ab6559eea8d2e9cb0610663b09f3a19df46f521b7",
            "sourceVersion": "owner-final-20261011-efbfdd21fa21",
            "quote": "维护首先不是修理，而是\n处理持续所产生的后果。修理通常发生在某个结构已经明显损坏之后，维\n护则更早，它关注的是一个仍然能够运行的现实，是否正在逐渐改变自己\n的承载条件。",
            "localStart": 0,
            "localEnd": 84,
            "absoluteStart": 915,
            "absoluteEnd": 999,
            "normalization": "LAYOUT_WHITESPACE_ONLY_CONTIGUOUS_SPAN",
            "noSemanticAcceptance": true
          }
        },
        {
          "state": "PASS_CONTIGUOUS_RAW_SPAN",
          "span": {
            "sourceId": "S3",
            "sourceSha256": "efbfdd21fa21c7e482bbe73ab6559eea8d2e9cb0610663b09f3a19df46f521b7",
            "sourceVersion": "owner-final-20261011-efbfdd21fa21",
            "quote": "运行能够持续，并不代表它正在可持续地继续。有些现实看起来稳\n定，只是因为更多时间、注意、资源、责任与载体能力仍然不断被投入；\n只要这些投入还没有完全耗尽，表面的连续就可以维持很久。",
            "localStart": 0,
            "localEnd": 90,
            "absoluteStart": 33,
            "absoluteEnd": 123,
            "normalization": "LAYOUT_WHITESPACE_ONLY_CONTIGUOUS_SPAN",
            "noSemanticAcceptance": true
          }
        },
        {
          "state": "PASS_CONTIGUOUS_RAW_SPAN",
          "span": {
            "sourceId": "S3",
            "sourceSha256": "efbfdd21fa21c7e482bbe73ab6559eea8d2e9cb0610663b09f3a19df46f521b7",
            "sourceVersion": "owner-final-20261011-efbfdd21fa21",
            "quote": "真正的问题从来不是“现在还能不能继续”，而是当前继续的方\n式，是否仍然保留下一轮继续所需要的条件。如果每一次推进都持续消耗\n恢复空间，每一次稳定都依赖少数位置超额承担，每一次变化都只能通过\n增加更多补偿来吸收，那么运行即使没有停止，也正在削弱自己的未来。",
            "localStart": 93,
            "localEnd": 220,
            "absoluteStart": 126,
            "absoluteEnd": 253,
            "normalization": "LAYOUT_WHITESPACE_ONLY_CONTIGUOUS_SPAN",
            "noSemanticAcceptance": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "semanticQualityUnchanged": true
    },
